# Badge states nothing can derive (#316): the written-down-debt
# pattern, one line per shield that waits on a human step or is
# exemplary with no data by construction. Everything else in the badge
# block is computed by fix:badges from the tree — see
# scaffold/README-badges.md for the catalogue and the vocabulary.
# bestpractices: 'pending' until the form binds, then the BP_ID.
# reuse: 'pending' until FSFE registration, then 'registered'.
# coverage: 'exemplary' — the canon wears its own coverage machinery
#   with no data behind it until the kcov standup lands (#316); the
#   permanence of this line is the point of an exemplar.
bestpractices pending
reuse pending
coverage exemplary
